# On-screen controls on the platform's own layout (TRAIL_DEBUG=town): the d-pad walks down the grid, MENU opens the
# start menu and B closes it. Touches go through the same hit testing as fingers (InputScript "touch"); used by the
# phone checks.
100 capture touch_start.png
110 touch 1 dpad 0 0.8
150 lift 1
180 tap 2 pause
220 capture touch_menu.png
240 tap 3 cancel
280 capture touch_end.png
300 quit
